{"scene_id": "s01187", "source": "/home/user/screenwrite-analyzers/data/analyzers/gen/scenes/s01187.fountain", "heading": "INT. TAXIDERMY WORKSHOP - NIGHT", "cast": [{"id": 0, "name": "INSPECTOR AMADI NWOSU", "names": ["INSPECTOR AMADI NWOSU", "AMADI"], "gender": "m", "first": 4, "spoke": 15}, {"id": 1, "name": "MAGDALENA CROSS", "names": ["MAGDALENA CROSS", "MAGDALENA"], "gender": "f", "first": 5, "spoke": 10}, {"id": 2, "name": "DANTE CROSS", "names": ["DANTE CROSS", "DANTE"], "gender": "m", "first": 5, "spoke": 3}, {"id": 3, "name": "DISPATCH", "names": ["DISPATCH"], "gender": "?", "first": 52, "spoke": 1}], "units": [{"u": 0, "kind": "heading", "text": "INT. TAXIDERMY WORKSHOP - NIGHT", "present": []}, {"u": 1, "kind": "action", "text": "A cathedral of dead things.", "para": 0, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 2, "kind": "action", "text": "Foxes mid-leap, owls on bent branches, a bear reared upright with one paw raised as though about to speak.", "para": 0, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 3, "kind": "action", "text": "Glass eyes catch the light of a single green desk lamp.", "para": 0, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 4, "kind": "action", "text": "INSPECTOR AMADI NWOSU (50s, long coat dripping, notebook in hand) stands in the doorway, letting his eyes adjust.", "para": 1, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 5, "kind": "action", "text": "At the back of the room, among tables strewn with scalpels and cotton wadding, a woman in a leather apron stands very still: MAGDALENA CROSS (40s, steady, sleeves rolled to the elbow, a smear of preservative on her cheek).", "para": 1, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 6, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Ms. Cross. You work late.", "name": "AMADI", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 7, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "So do you.", "name": "MAGDALENA", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 8, "kind": "action", "text": "She does not move.", "para": 2, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 9, "kind": "action", "text": "He walks in slowly, studying the shelves.", "para": 2, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 10, "kind": "action", "text": "Amadi stops at the bear and tilts his head.", "para": 2, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 11, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Beautiful piece. Whose is it?", "name": "AMADI", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 12, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "A collector's.", "name": "MAGDALENA", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 13, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "A collector who disappeared on Tuesday.", "name": "AMADI", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 14, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Did he? I'd have charged him for the storage.", "name": "MAGDALENA", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 15, "kind": "action", "text": "Amadi crosses to the desk.", "para": 3, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 16, "kind": "action", "text": "A mug, half-drunk tea, a ledger.", "para": 3, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 17, "kind": "action", "text": "He turns a page with one finger.", "para": 3, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 18, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Your ledger shows three deliveries that night. Your neighbor says only one truck.", "name": "AMADI", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 19, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "My neighbor likes trucks.", "name": "MAGDALENA", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 20, "kind": "action", "text": "Behind the desk, a door ajar.", "para": 4, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 21, "kind": "action", "text": "A faint sound, a scrape.", "para": 4, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 22, "kind": "action", "text": "Amadi's eyes flick to it.", "para": 4, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 23, "kind": "action", "text": "Magdalena's do not.", "para": 4, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 24, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Who's back there?", "name": "AMADI", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 25, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Nobody.", "name": "MAGDALENA", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 26, "kind": "action", "text": "The door creaks wider.", "para": 5, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 27, "kind": "action", "text": "A boy of fifteen's silhouette slips through, pale, a hoodie pulled up.", "para": 5, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 28, "kind": "action", "text": "He lunges for the exit.", "para": 5, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 29, "kind": "action", "text": "Amadi sidesteps and grabs his sleeve; the boy twists, Magdalena drops a scalpel on the table with a clang, and for one long second all three of them struggle in a knot of limbs beside the bear.", "para": 5, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 30, "kind": "action", "text": "The boy's hood falls back.", "para": 5, "sent": 4, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 31, "kind": "action", "text": "DANTE CROSS (15, her son, hollow-eyed) glares at Amadi.", "para": 5, "sent": 5, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 32, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Let go of me.", "name": "DANTE", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 33, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Easy, son.", "name": "AMADI", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 34, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Dante, stop.", "name": "MAGDALENA", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 35, "kind": "action", "text": "Dante stops.", "para": 6, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 36, "kind": "action", "text": "Amadi releases him.", "para": 6, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 37, "kind": "action", "text": "The boy backs away until he bumps into the bear and presses against its fur.", "para": 6, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 38, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Ms. Cross, where is he?", "name": "AMADI", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": ["quietly"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 39, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I told you. A collector's.", "name": "MAGDALENA", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": ["a long beat"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 40, "kind": "action", "text": "Amadi's phone buzzes in his pocket.", "para": 7, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 41, "kind": "action", "text": "He ignores it.", "para": 7, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 42, "kind": "action", "text": "It buzzes again.", "para": 7, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 43, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "How old are you?", "name": "AMADI", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": ["to Dante"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 44, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Fifteen.", "name": "DANTE", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 45, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Fifteen. And tonight you got up and did your mother's work, didn't you? Because she asked.", "name": "AMADI", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 46, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "She didn't ask.", "name": "DANTE", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": ["whisper"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 47, "kind": "action", "text": "Magdalena closes her eyes.", "para": 8, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 48, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I need to answer this.", "name": "AMADI", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 49, "kind": "action", "text": "He takes out the phone.", "para": 9, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 50, "kind": "action", "text": "Answers.", "para": 9, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 51, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Nwosu.", "name": "AMADI", "speaker": 0, "ext": ["CONT'D"], "paren": ["into phone"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 52, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Inspector, we found the body. Riverbank, north of the bridge. He's been there since Tuesday. Cause of death, blunt trauma.", "name": "DISPATCH", "speaker": 3, "ext": ["V.O."], "paren": ["over phone, tinny"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 53, "kind": "action", "text": "Amadi lowers the phone slowly.", "para": 10, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 54, "kind": "action", "text": "He looks at Magdalena.", "para": 10, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 55, "kind": "action", "text": "At Dante.", "para": 10, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 56, "kind": "action", "text": "At the bear, whose glass eyes seem to look back.", "para": 10, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 57, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Hold there.", "name": "AMADI", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": ["into phone"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 58, "kind": "action", "text": "He hangs up.", "para": 11, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 59, "kind": "action", "text": "The workshop is silent.", "para": 11, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 60, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "So he never got stuffed.", "name": "AMADI", "speaker": 0, "ext": ["CONT'D"], "paren": ["to Magdalena"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 61, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "No.", "name": "MAGDALENA", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 62, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Then what's in the back room?", "name": "AMADI", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 63, "kind": "action", "text": "Dante makes a small sound.", "para": 12, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 64, "kind": "action", "text": "Magdalena turns and walks to the door.", "para": 12, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 65, "kind": "action", "text": "She opens it wide.", "para": 12, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 66, "kind": "action", "text": "Inside, on a steel table under a sheet, a long shape.", "para": 12, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 67, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "The dog.", "name": "MAGDALENA", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 68, "kind": "action", "text": "Amadi stares.", "para": 13, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 69, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "His dog. He asked me to keep it. That's all he ever asked.", "name": "MAGDALENA", "speaker": 1, "ext": ["CONT'D"], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 70, "kind": "action", "text": "She pulls back the sheet.", "para": 14, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 71, "kind": "action", "text": "A greyhound, perfectly preserved, its eyes bright.", "para": 14, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 72, "kind": "action", "text": "Amadi lets out a long breath.", "para": 14, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 73, "kind": "action", "text": "Dante covers his face.", "para": 14, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 74, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Well. That's not on the ledger either.", "name": "AMADI", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": ["to the dog"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 75, "kind": "action", "text": "He pockets the notebook.", "para": 15, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 76, "kind": "action", "text": "Behind him the bear lifts its paw as if to wave goodbye.", "para": 15, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}]}